	(text "RACK DOMAIN: external 12 V DIN supply (floating output); its 0 V is GND_RACK. Reverse polarity: P-FET Q1.\nTransients: TVS D31. Fuse F20. Feeds the relay outputs, the CAN1 cable supply and U20.\nU20 (TRACO TDN 5-2411WI, 9-36 V in, 5 V 1 A, 1600 VDC) makes the floating LOGIC +5V / GND."
